== History ==
2025
*The Spirit Empress [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 7/7/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/7/2025)|July 2025 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 10/7/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (10/7/2025)|maintenance break]], increased the Spirit Empress Ground Form hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Buff}} and decreased her Air Form's attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Spirit Empress' hitpoints in both forms by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}, and her Air Form's range to 5 tiles (from 4.5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 1/9/2025, a Balance Update, decreased the Spirit Empress' Air Form Hitpoints decreased by 10%.
*On 3/11/25, a Balance Update, increased the Spirit Empress' Ground Form Hitpoints by 10%.
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Spirit Empress' Ground speed to fast (from medium), decreased her Ground hitpoints by 7%, and decreased her Air Hitpoints by 1%.
* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Sprirt Empress' Ground Hitpoints by 3% and decreased her Air Hitpoints by 5%. Her ground hit speed was also increased to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds)

