== Trivia ==
*The Spirit Empress is 1 of 20 [[cards]] associated with nobility, with the others being [[Knight]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Royal Giant]], [[Royal Delivery]], [[Tower Princess]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Prince]], [[Raging Prince]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Princess]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Super Knight]], [[Dagger Duchess]], [[Royal Chef]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], and the [[Little Prince]].
*The Spirit Empress is the only variable-Elixir cost card with a clearly defined Elixir cost.
*The Spirit Empress is the only card without [[Star Points|Star Levels]]. Others are {{Rarity|Champion}} [[cards]].
*The card's description introducing the Spirit Empress, "''the First of Her Name, Protector of Spirits, Rider of Dragons.''" is a reference to Daenerys Targaryen, a character from the series Game of Thrones, based on the novel series A Song Of Fire & Ice by George R. R. Martin. 
* When deployed in her air form, the Spirit Empress may say "''Wings up!''" or "''Skyward!''".
* The Spirit Empress is the subject of 3 [[Emotes]].
*[https://ocellusart.artstation.com/projects/GvPL8Q Concept art] by the Supercell Art Team and Ocellus Art team shows the many designs the Spirit Empress went through.
*Every time she attacks (in Ground form), her target will have a glowing cyan blue effect. 

